  "details": "A way to disable someones Shader by clicking on them, and then hit a button that says \"Disable Shader\". This will either disable all shaders from that person, or disables the shader from that specific avatar globally. \nWith this you can still hide all players avatars, but if you show someones avatars and his shader is making you lag you can disable it. \nThis currently isn't possible since you can either show every avatar without shader (with the safety settings) or show no avatar at all and always see the ones you have shown WITH a shader\n^^",
